// The ending (E-1, EN2 for lead 39; plans/ending-spec.html, "The Veyli ship comes back"): Saturday Day 34 from 10:00,
// near Saruth, once. Taavek's ship is off the bow again; Saruth says it will fly with the Wren to the Line. A stand-in for
// SW6's words (about 6 lines). Saruth is they/them; every Veyli is.
title: Company
from: Saruth
gist: Saruth: Taavek's ship will fly beside the Wren to the Line.
== lines
saruth > you: You have seen it? Off the bow. Taavek's ship, again.
saruth: They will fly beside the Wren to the Line. Company, the other way.
? choice
* That's kind of them.   rel:saruth+1
  saruth: Kind, yes. And they want to see the Line for themselves. Both.
* Will you miss the reach?   rel:saruth+2
  saruth: The reach does not stay behind at the Line. It comes with me. Like a coat.
saruth: Tomorrow I read their last signal to the crew. The Captain asked. I said yes before she finished.
